# Google OAuth client for the phone app (Google Cloud console → Credentials).
# Create an "iOS" client (bundle id = ios.bundleIdentifier) and/or an "Android" client
# (package name + SHA-1) and paste its client ID here. Native clients have no secret.
# Needs a development build (`npx expo run:ios|android` or EAS); Expo Go cannot use it.
EXPO_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
